      "id": 138719,
      "name": "cmschex",
      "username": "cmschex",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-01T00:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Short answer: Proletariat is essentially the Absolute Zero of the Tactics set, a high complexity character who is not as instinctively easily to \"grok\" as many of the other characters. &nbsp;Also, because he is so positioning dependant, he is at the mercy of the map setup more so than most other charcters since he is melee only.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That being said, he's extremely powerfull when played by someone who knows how and I expect we will see him more in tournaments that have more experienced players</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:15:17.682Z",
